ts. Exact owned internal sketch linear/radius/diameter drivers can use expression to bind named User variables, followed by native sketch solving and scoped consumer rebuild. Read returned owner_kind/sketch_id/constraint_id and actual relation metadata; literal reference measurements and unverified angular families are not driving controls. set_sketch_constraint_parameter retains its literal-only contract. Use returned body_ref, refreshed history/topology and the intended part/drawing at a meaningful checkpoint. A healthy feature or stored value alone does not prove the engineering result. Recovery/Undo is uncertain; unknown is neither success nor rollback. Does not save.",
