            Name = "nanocad.modify_entities",
            Description = PlaneCurveTransformSchema394.Scope + " " + "rebuild_model requests one native part rebuild using the current expected_last_item_id; inspect returned native_rebuild_accepted, model_healthy and unresolved_nodes. set_model_feature_suppressed suppresses or restores an actual history feature while retaining unselected flags and sources; use its current expected_suppressed and last item. Read parametric guidance for pending-history eligibility. delete_model_feature removes one ordinary non-base terminal Fillet/Chamfer/Shell/Mirror or sole-consumer extrusion/revolution with fresh deletion_token, explicit resulting terminal and retirable_driver_ids; a profile consumer requires expected_retained_profile_id and releases only its exact profile links, retaining actual profile/sketch/sources/observed controls. No other forming cascade is inferred; native auxiliary cleanup/recovery is uncertain. " + "set_hatch_association detaches or rebinds actual same-space closed zero-width Polyline Line/Arc bulges, Circle or full Ellipse boundaries and strictly inside separate holes with a fresh hatch_token. Native finite curve intersections/Region containment and stored primitive readback preserve Hatch identity/pattern/source geometry and exact bidirectional links; verified_boundaries reports source types/roles; started recovery is uncertain. set_tolerance edits the exact native FeatureControlFrame codes/XY placement/radians rotation/style/text height/scale/gap with a fresh geometry.tolerance_token; native glyph and design semantics remain the drawing requirements. set_dimension_definition/display/format support arc-length and jogged-radius along with the previous seven native kinds. If jogged-radius opens as ImpDimension, only an exact native RX descriptor match permits borrowed typed access; native_binding retains actual opened and verified definition types. Arc partial/symbol/leader controls are observed and retained by these dedicated edits. Placement retains mode flags/jog angle and checks transformed active leader anchors; partial-parameter physical-span transform semantics remain an actual result/image observation. No source geometry or associations are created. " + ConstructionCurveSchema443.Scope + " " + "set_text_format formats native TEXT using geometry.formatting.editing.text_token, authoritative native justification anchors and actual returned size; create Text.format supplies matching typography. Batch distinct notes and preserve their contents. " + MLeaderInstanceSchema442.Guidance + " " + "set_mtext_format edits stored style/layout of an existing native note with fresh geometry.formatting.editing.mtext_token, retaining exact raw contents and native anchors; no paragraph replacement. set_table_cell_value writes native numeric values/units/formats and set_table_style assigns an existing native local TableStyle with fresh table_token, preserving explicit overrides and unselected content. Read exact schemas and raw cell metadata rather than formatted text. Started native formatting has no guaranteed rollback. set_dimension_format edits the supported effective style/size/precision/deviation fields of nine native dimension types; inspect_objects returns geometry.format and explicitly identified native deviation units. set_properties supports layer/ACI or RGB color/transparency/linetype/lineweight/linetype_scale/visible on ordinary entities and exact native Table/MLeader/Dimension/Hatch/Region/Helix/BlockReference roots; erase deletes these native entities. Basic BlockReference root properties/erase work in Model or active Paper and do not require traversing its definition. This does not extend block transform/copy scope. imprint_solid marks one existing direct solid with retained native curve copies in their actual WCS positions. Read the target topology token and each inspect_objects geometry.native_curve.curve_token; the native kernel decides contact. No projection, source erasure, persistent source association or